Syntax: cast 'blast of fury' <target>

Blast of Fury channels the caster's anger and frustration into a devastating
burst of magical energy directed at a single target. The spell transforms
emotional negativity into raw destructive force, making it more potent when
the caster is truly enraged.

This single-target attack spell deals significant damage, drawing power from
the caster's emotional state. Warriors who dabble in the arcane arts find
this spell particularly satisfying, though pure mages can master it as well.

The spell requires a clear target and direct line of sight. Unlike cold or
fire-based attacks, the blast of fury has no elemental association and
cannot be resisted through elemental protection spells.

See Also: MYSTIC DARTS, STUNNING ARROW
